GnBots Kingshot Bot is a cloud automation tool designed to handle repetitive Kingshot tasks without requiring a PC or Android emulator.

## Auto Farming

Automate repetitive farming tasks without manually managing your accounts throughout the day.

Benefits:

- Run 24/7
- Reduce manual grinding
- Save time
- Manage multiple accounts

