## 24/7 Cloud Automation

Unlike traditional Kingshot bots that require a computer or Android emulator, GnBots runs directly from cloud servers.

Benefits:

- No BlueStacks required
- No Android emulator
- No PC running 24/7
- Access through your browser
- Manage multiple accounts from one dashboard

